water-network.json is TrackStan's modified source-form projection, under the
same MPL-2.0 license. It retains 6,825 edges and removes 821 edges that touch
or intersect known land, including edges wholly inside land. Lines are split
at exclusions; no replacement connector or endpoint shift is introduced.
