Natural Earth data is public domain:
https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/
The reproducible projection is scripts/marine-route-land-filter.mjs in the
application repository. It compares Mercator segments, respects polygon
holes and splits antimeridian crossings. Generalized coastlines omit small
islands and detail; conservatively removed canals may disconnect valid
waterways. Passing this filter is not proof of real-world navigability.

